Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.74,0:02:15.24,TITLE2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(730,915)\fs80\fad(500,0)\c&H1FE4FF&\3c&HF4380B&}安逸領主的愉快領地防衛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.44,0:05:46.37,TITLE1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,700)\c&H3A3D20&\3c&HFFFFFF&\fs100\be1\bord10\pos(1018,862)}莎朗 · 托拉 · 斐迪奈
